  designNotes: 'A friendly creature goes back to your hand (with the next Day''s
    hand), and you draw 1 more next Day. Played again, its Arrival happens again,
    and it comes back fresh: a reset for a hurt creature, a second Arrival for one
    with a good one (Threat Hunter, Sex Clanker). Unlike Shadow Ops.'' Extraction,
    no new face, a card instead.'
  artDescription: A huge curved UNDO arrow pulling a startled knight backwards off
    a battlefield into a playing card held up by a hand, the keys CTRL and Z glowing
    on a keyboard below.
